---
---
<section id="about" class="px-8 md:px-16 py-16 bg-[#050505]">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
    <img src="/section-divider.svg" alt="" class="h-5 opacity-80" />
    <span class="text-fire text-sm tracking-[4px] uppercase">About</span>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start max-w-3xl">
    <div class="flex-1">
      <h2 class="font-serif font-black text-white text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-tight mb-5">
        From the Heart<br />of the Bronx
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#bbb] text-base leading-relaxed">
        Frankie Rocco grew up working in his mother's pizzeria in the Bronx, learning the craft
        from the ground up, tossing dough the old way, using the right ingredients and nothing else.
        When he relocated to Los Angeles, he brought the whole operation with him: the same family
        recipe passed down three generations, Polly-O mozzarella, Perfect Diamond flour. By family
        request, no substitutions.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#bbb] text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
        Over 45 years of forming dough balls and building community from the Palisades to Topanga.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#bbb] text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
        Like a lot of families from those hills, the Roccos lost their place but not their purpose.
        Now back at it in a shiny new truck, we'd love to invite you to ride again anywhere in LA.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Uncomment when a photo is available:
    <img
      src="/frankie.jpg"
      alt="Frankie Rocco"
      loading="lazy"
      class="w-32 md:w-48 object-cover flex-shrink-0"
    />
    -->
  </div>

  <!-- Stats strip -->
  <div class="flex gap-12 mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[#111]">
    <div>
      <div class="font-serif font-black text-fire text-2xl" style="text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(232,137,10,0.3)">45+</div>
      <div class="text-[#888] text-xs tracking-[2px] uppercase mt-1">Years of Craft</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="font-serif font-black text-[#f5c842] text-2xl" style="text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(245,200,66,0.2)">3</div>
      <div class="text-[#888] text-xs tracking-[2px] uppercase mt-1">Generations</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="font-serif font-black text-teal text-2xl" style="text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(46,196,182,0.2)">1</div>
      <div class="text-[#888] text-xs tracking-[2px] uppercase mt-1">Secret Recipe</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="flex items-center px-8 md:px-16 py-4">
  <div class="flex-1 h-px" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #2ec4b6)"></div>
  <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-teal mx-3 rotate-45 shrink-0" style="box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(46,196,182,0.4)"></div>
  <div class="flex-1 h-px" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2ec4b6, transparent)"></div>
</div>
